* [x] Redesign AI responses to feel like a modern financial AI assistant.
* [x] Replace large walls of text with structured sections where appropriate.
* [x] Use compact metric cards for important financial numbers.
* [x] Use readable responsive tables for detailed data.
* [x] Use charts for useful numerical comparisons and trends.
* [x] Make tool results expandable rather than dumping raw tool output into the conversation.
* [x] Maintain consistent typography, spacing, hierarchy, and component behavior.
* [x] Prevent overflowing numbers, broken tables, excessive blank space, and unnecessarily large paragraphs.
* [x] Make the experience work well on both desktop and smaller screens.

